<title>UK: Hanson says may sell Grove Worldwide unit.</title>
<headline>Hanson says may sell Grove Worldwide unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-based materials and services group Hanson Plc said on Monday it had hired Goldman Sachs to handle a possible sale of its Grove Worldwide unit, a maker of hydraulic cranes.</p>
</text>
